 "script": "Your boxed copy of GTA 6 might have no code inside. There's no disc, just a download code, so no code means no game. Some buyers say their code was missing, or already used. Some say stores refused to swap the box. Kotaku says it's unclear how many boxes are affected, and Rockstar hadn't commented when it published. If your box is empty, go back to the store first. Open it in front of staff, so there's proof. Launch is almost here, so check yours now. Did your code work? Comment yes or no.",
